OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy and breezy
OL,6,Fmorning with any outbreaks of rain
OL,7,Fgradually fading away. Many parts dry,
OL,8,Fespecially by the afternoon, with good
OL,9,Fspells of sunshine developing. Winds
OL,10,Falso easing, with temperatures near or
OL,11,Fjust below normal for October.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FCloud thickening from the
OL,14,Fsouthwest through the evening as rain
OL,15,Fand strengthening winds spread
OL,16,Fnortheast. Perhaps briefly drier early
OL,17,FFriday morning.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
