OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CFriday:FOutbreaks of occasionally
OL,6,Fheavy rain expected, along with
OL,7,Fstrengthening winds. However some
OL,8,Fdrier intervals are also likely.
OL,9,FStrongest winds are likely to be
OL,10,Fthrough the evening, as rain clears
OL,11,Feast.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FChilly
OL,14,Fstart Saturday, but turning wet and
OL,15,Fwindy with rain spreading east. Windy
OL,16,FSunday, but largely dry with sunny
OL,17,Fintervals, Further rain and stronger
OL,18,Fwinds follow early Monday
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
